  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released the Admit Card for the post of Specialist Officers SO. This recruitment has been issued for 395 posts. The online application process for Union Bank of India SO Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 21 July 2026, to 10 August 2026. The Exam is going to conducted on 06 September 2026. Candidates must download their Union Bank of India SO Admit Card 2026, which are given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Union Bank of India (UBI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Union Bank of India SO Admit Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>21 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>10 August 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>10 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : <strong>06 September 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>31 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<t